    "html": "<p>Two resistors are connected to a cell. The emf of the cell is 20 V and the potential difference across the 4 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span> resistor is 8 V.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the internal resistance of the cell?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">4 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">6 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">8 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Omega\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
